      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://canbyhistory.com/birth-of-a-city",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Canby's first post office opened in 1874, marking the town’s emergence as a formal community hub.",
